# STEM Learning Analytics — End-to-End ML Workflow

An evidence-grounded feasibility study that classifies English STEM benchmark questions into mathematics, physics, chemistry, or biology using a leakage-safe TF-IDF + linear-model workflow.

這是一個可重現的端到端機器學習作品集：重點不是前端 demo，而是資料治理、SQL、去重與防洩漏切分、超參數調整、一次性測試集評估、錯誤診斷與限制分析。

